E-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">여석이 있는 경우 학생본인이 전산으로 수강신청 가능</font></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">여석이 있는 강좌의 변경은 제한없음</font></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#f15f5f\">여석이 없는 경우 2과목 이내로 “수강과목 변경 신청서”에 해당강좌 교수님의 확인후 종합학사행정실에 제출 학부(과) 조교선생님이 수강신청처리 </font></strong></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- <font color=\"#0900ff\">이미 </font></span></span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">수강신청한 과목 중 삭제할 과목</u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">학생 본인</u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">수강신청사이트</u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">에서 신청된 과목 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>직접 삭제</u></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">하여야 함</span></font></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-<font color=\"#f15f5f\"> </font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#f15f5f\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">학기초과학생, 졸업학기생, 역학기생,&nbsp;복수전공, 부전공생, 교직이수생, 전과생, 편입생, </span>2월수강신청기간 이후 복학생은 3과목 이상 변경 신청 가능</font></strong></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 지</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">도교수와 수강상담 및 승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">변</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">경(추가, 삭제)이 가능함.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 고급</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국어1(LA0283), 고급한국어2</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(LA0284),기술경영(BD0037)과목은 외국인 학부생만 수강신청 할 수 있음</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 계약학과 개설 과목은 계약학과생만 신청가능</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid; TEXT-ALIGN: left; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"86\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">폐강.합반.분반과목 수강정정기간</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid; TEXT-ALIGN: left; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"148\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span 